  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hi!\n\nAllowing Groups to link an Instance to a Group Announcement/Post would be a great addition to the Group system and a very good improvement to all communities out there. \n\nThis feature would make it significantly easier for members to join and participate in group events etc., reducing friction and confusion around where an event is happening, where it is located and overall a good QoL Improvement. \n\nex; when opening a Instance, there's an Input field in which you can put an instance link like ; \n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_xxxxx~group(grp_xxxx-xxxxx-xxxx-xxxx)~groupAccessType(public)~region(us)\n\nWhich then shows on the group announcement with an embed image of the world or a simple 'Join Instance' button pushed to User's notifications.",
